"README.en.md","22","omicslab","This is version **2.1.1** (2026-10-24). The product is now named SuWen (绱犻棶), while the Python package name (`omicslab`), legacy APIs, and the `.omicslab` data directory are kept for compatibility. Per-item status for the 24 V2 requirements is tracked in the [implementation checklist](docs/SUWEN-V2-CHECKLIST.md): only branding and multi-level settings are marked ""implemented""; the rest are partially implemented or limited by external environments."
"README.en.md","120","omicslab","The launcher uses port **8766**, prefers the repository's `.venv` Python, and keeps its data directory in `.omicslab` under the repository (already covered by `.gitignore`). Started directly from the CLI, the default port is **5077**; pass `--port 8766` to match the launcher:"
"README.en.md","123","omicslab","python -m omicslab serve --port 8766"
"README.en.md","131","omicslab","python -m omicslab serve --port 8766"
"README.en.md","142","omicslab","python -m omicslab serve # CLI default: http://127.0.0.1:5077"
"README.en.md","145","omicslab","Open the address printed in the terminal (5077 by default). Run `python -m omicslab env` (alias `doctor`) for a health check; add `--json` for scripts. Offline installs, Jupyter kernel interpreter selection, long paths, and firewall notes are covered in the [installation guide](docs/INSTALL.md) and the [FAQ](docs/FAQ.md)."
"README.en.md","185","omicslab","| Web UI | `omicslab/web/**` | Native ES-modules SPA, 20 routes, no build step |"
"README.en.md","186","omicslab","| Server | `omicslab/server/**` | FastAPI + uvicorn, REST/SSE/WS, origin checks, singleton services |"
"README.en.md","187","omicslab","| Runtime | `omicslab/runtime/**` | `RunService`, `EventStore`, approvals, subtasks |"
"README.en.md","188","omicslab","| Agent | `omicslab/agent/**` | Agent loop, providers, tool registry, skills, memory |"
"README.en.md","189","omicslab","| Execution | `omicslab/execution/**` | Local and SSH backends; remote failures never fall back to local |"
"README.en.md","190","omicslab","| Kernel | `omicslab/kernel/**` | Persistent IPython kernel, variable introspection, figure capture |"
"README.en.md","191","omicslab","| Data | `~/.omicslab` and workspaces | SQLite, JSON, Markdown, PNG |"
"README.en.md","252","omicslab","- Bug reports should include the version (`python -m omicslab --version`), OS, Python version, and redacted logs."
