"docs\architecture\current.md","4","omicslab","Read-only source audit of the supplied `outputs/omicslab` repository. No applicable AGENTS.md found in repository or checked ancestor chain. `.omicslab` user state and credentials were not opened. Source Git status was clean before parent created a rollback baseline and implementation branch."
"docs\architecture\current.md","7","omicslab","- `pyproject.toml:5-15,46-78`: Python >=3.10, setuptools, FastAPI/Uvicorn/Jupyter/httpx/Paramiko; version 2.1.1; Apache-2.0; distribution name remains omicslab and exports both suwen/omicslab console scripts."
"docs\architecture\current.md","8","omicslab","- `omicslab/web/js/app.js`, `web/js/views/*`: native ES Modules SPA. No package.json, Electron main/preload, TypeScript, renderer bundler, or NSIS installer pipeline exists in baseline. The attachment's assumption of an existing Electron+TypeScript stack does not match source reality."
"docs\architecture\current.md","9","omicslab","- `omicslab/server/app.py:66-145`: FastAPI composition and static web hosting; localhost CORS/origin checks and terminal WebSocket origin rejection. No Content-Security-Policy header was found. APIs do not have per-process authentication, so a new daemon needs its own authenticated loopback transport."
"docs\architecture\current.md","10","omicslab","- `omicslab/server/state.py:101-192`: composition root owns kernel, stores, AgentLoop and RunService; backend lifecycle is tied to Python server."
"docs\architecture\current.md","11","omicslab","- `omicslab/runtime/events.py:184-201,342-368`: version-3 SQLite/WAL event log, foreign keys, synchronous=NORMAL, crash reconciliation to interrupted. `runtime/runs.py:197-280,475-500,554-619`: submit-id deduplication, persist-before-broadcast, replayable SSE, cancellation and child runs."
"docs\architecture\current.md","12","omicslab","- `omicslab/suwen/store.py:37-57,73-90`: second SQLite/WAL generic-record store, per-record revisions and optimistic expected-version support. Task/node/audit changes are separate transactions; no lease, fencing, outbox or durable timer tables."
"docs\architecture\current.md","13","omicslab","- `omicslab/session/store.py:119-132`: atomic JSON conversation save. This should remain compatible as legacy data, not be rewritten indiscriminately."
"docs\architecture\current.md","14","omicslab","- `omicslab/suwen/tasks.py:40-49,107-125,143-240`: persisted task DAG plus in-memory asyncio dispatch; server restart changes running to interrupted, requiring confirmation. Completed nodes are skipped on resume. Does not provide standalone OS daemon, lease ownership, durable retry schedule, or automatic safe crash recovery."
"docs\architecture\current.md","15","omicslab","- `omicslab/session/jobs.py:68-75,122-129,189-202`: older job layer stores jobs in memory, uses daemon threads and local subprocesses, and terminates jobs on backend shutdown."
"docs\architecture\current.md","16","omicslab","- `omicslab/suwen/models.py:22-52`: compaction uses serialized character size, discards old history, shortens system text, and adds small excerpts. No independent ContextManager, real tokenizer accounting, versioned structured summary, coverage/hash validation, or replay/retrieval contract."
"docs\architecture\current.md","17","omicslab","- `omicslab/agent/loop.py:209-226`: an additional character-bound history trim is independent of model compaction. It can discard earlier user constraints even before gateway compaction."
"docs\architecture\current.md","18","omicslab","- `omicslab/suwen/knowledge.py:83-150`: workspace-scoped memory has digest deduplication, provenance locator, expiry, optional configured embeddings, and lexical search; useful to preserve but not a compaction substitute."
"docs\architecture\current.md","19","omicslab","- `omicslab/suwen/vault.py:14-47`: Windows DPAPI encryption; session-only behavior elsewhere, no plaintext fallback. `suwen/service.py:80-100` enforces per-tool/workspace policy and remote-channel read-only restrictions. `agent/tools.py:325-329` makes explicit ask policy mandatory."
"docs\architecture\current.md","20","omicslab","- `omicslab/web/js/views/chat.js:557-571,788-810`: full historical message rendering and requestAnimationFrame live Markdown re-render; no long-history virtualization. `web/js/sse.js:93-137`: stream retries avoid replay after content has arrived."
"docs\architecture\current.md","25","OMICSLAB","Ran Python from `C:/ProgramData/miniconda3/python.exe` with separate OMICSLAB_HOME under current chat `work/audit-test-home`, disabled bytecode and pytest cache writes, mock provider, and removed API credential variables in that child process. Test fixtures create their own temporary homes/workspaces. No actual model or SSH account was used."
"docs\architecture\migration-plan.md","3","omicslab","Rollback baseline: Git tag `suwen-vnext-baseline-20261024` at `8cabac3`; implementation branch `suwen-vnext-durable`. Source was clean before work. Existing ignored `.omicslab` runtime/user files are neither read nor committed. No destructive migration."
